# FP-reasoning: HIGH, network_mode=any (pure L3/L4). NON-payload (spec §22 C1): no
# fast_pattern; decisive condition = an illegal TCP flag combination. SYN+FIN can
# never occur in a legitimate TCP stack (connection-open and connection-close at
# once) -> attacker-unique scan/evasion. Single-event, no threshold needed.
